# Non-secret, per-project settings. Copy to `.env.<projectId>` (for example
# `.env.customer-service-dev-ff0dc`); the Firebase CLI loads the one matching
# the project being deployed. Real files are gitignored.
#
# Secrets (Razorpay keys, webhook secrets) never go here. They go in Secret
# Manager: `firebase functions:secrets:set RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET`.
#
# No settings are needed yet. Add each one here, with a comment, when the code
# that reads it is added.
